{
  "name": "Hidden Building Pieces",
  "author": "AgentKush",
  "version": "4.5",
  "description": "v4.5: Rebuilt for the November 2026 frame rework. 5 frames used blueprints the update deleted (the Iron full and half frames and the Limestone, Reinforced Wood and Sandworm half frames) and now use the game's current frame blueprints. The 3 Iron frames, the 2 Sandworm frames and the Metal Grate quarter floor can now be crafted - their recipes asked for items that do not exist - and cost what the game charges for its own Iron beams, Sandworm beams and metal grate floor. Fixed the stability, piece types, materials and icons the game renamed or removed, and removed 66 leftover rows from pieces that are now in the base game.",
  "fileName": "Hidden_Building_Pieces",
  "imageURL": "https://github.com/AgentKush/Icarus-mods/raw/main/icons/Hidden_Building_Pieces.png",
  "readmeURL": "https://github.com/AgentKush/Icarus-mods/raw/main/Hidden_Building_Pieces/README.md",
  "week": "All",
  "Level2": "True",
